"ctrl": "<thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Keyboard / mouse</th><th>Gamepad</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Move</td><td>WASD / arrows</td><td>Left stick / D-pad</td></tr><tr><td>Attack (manual mode)</td><td>J / left click</td><td>X / right trigger</td></tr><tr><td>Dash</td><td>Space / right click</td><td>A / left trigger</td></tr><tr><td>Auto or manual attack</td><td>Tab / R</td><td>Y</td></tr><tr><td>Pause</td><td>Esc / P</td><td>Start</td></tr><tr><td>Fullscreen · info · screenshot</td><td>F11 · F3 · F12</td><td></td></tr></tbody>",
