"road": "<li>Real hand-made maps and more playable characters</li><li>Online leaderboard for each stage, with a nickname of your choice</li><li>More bosses with their own attacks and animations</li><li>Touch controls for phones and tablets</li><li>Builds for Linux, macOS and Android</li>",
