"legal": "<p><strong>A Survivor to the Past</strong> is an <strong>unofficial, free and non-commercial fan game</strong>, made for fun. <strong>Selling it, or any part of it, is forbidden.</strong></p><p><em>The Legend of Zelda</em>, <em>A Link to the Past</em>, <em>The Minish Cap</em>, their characters, graphics, music and sound effects are trademarks and copyrighted works of <strong>Nintendo</strong>. All Nintendo assets used here belong to Nintendo. This project is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by Nintendo.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/BigFatDeuce/A-Survivor-to-the-Past/blob/main/LICENSE\" rel=\"noopener\">GPL-3.0 license</a> only covers the source code written for this project; it grants no rights over Nintendo's assets. Sprite sheets come from the rips shared by the community of <em>The Spriters Resource</em> — thanks to their authors.</p><p>The name of every sprite ripper and artist (Barack Obama, Mister Man, Nemau, Aztec Warrior, Deathbringer, Barubary, Vaati, Mister Mike, Ragnarockerbunny and many more) is listed in <strong><a href=\"CREDITS.md\" rel=\"noopener\">CREDITS.md</a></strong>. Shy Guy also belongs to Nintendo; <em>Sonic the Hedgehog</em> is a trademark of <strong>SEGA</strong>.</p><p>Rights holders: to have content removed, open an issue or contact us on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8f62M2eaK\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord</a>.</p>",
